1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,330
Perhatikan aliran darah

2
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:02,640
di pembuluh kaki ini.

3
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:04,910
Katup di dalam vena membantu

4
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:06,860
darah bergerak menuju jantung.

5
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:09,430
Ketika katup tidak menutup rapat,

6
00:00:09,430 --> 00:00:10,840
sebagian darah mengalir

7
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:12,280
kembali dan berkumpul.

8
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:14,710
Lama-kelamaan, vena melebar,

9
00:00:14,710 --> 00:00:16,720
berkelok, dan tampak menonjol.

10
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:18,560
Inilah salah satu mekanisme

11
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:19,560
terjadinya varises.

12
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:21,740
Sekarang lihat perbedaannya.

13
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:23,700
Katup yang menutup rapat

14
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:25,320
menjaga aliran tetap naik,

15
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,090
sementara katup yang melemah

16
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:28,450
membiarkan sebagian darah

17
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:29,140
turun lagi.

